# SfxLab family v2: layer id name type dur seed key=value... (dur 0 = endless) · range id param lo hi [note] · bind signal id|* param [lo hi] [rel] [steps=N | scale=<chord>] · note text · then `spell <id>` sections: name, recipe, the spell's layers at their lock values, its binds and notes
bench 1
root 65.4064
# voltaic: electricity as its own family. A hollow mains hum, four coil tones that sputter until the ratios lock, spark ticks that
# fuse into a buzz with coherence, interference crackle and a lifted surge that follow the pen. Dry, close, erratic until locked.
