range hum level 0.15 0.2 the mains hum at C2: a sine with a hollow harmonic bank (even harmonics faded), synthesized so it holds steady. The only bass.
range swell level 0.08 0.18 the discovery drone (F1 -48c) lifted to C3, sines only: it surges and fades on its own 20 s cycle; in with stir
range root level 0 0.1 C4: a saw tone, gated at random (lfo shape 3) until the ratios lock
range root lfo>amp 0.1 0.9 the stutter: erratic sparking at coherence 0, a steady coil tone at 1
range third level 0 0.09 E4
range fifth level 0 0.09 G4
range seventh level 0 0.07 Bb4
range sparks level 0.2 0.45 FM ticks at C7: a few a second even at rest, up with stir
range sparks density 3 40 the spark rate: scattered ticks at coherence 0, fused into a buzz at 1
range crackle level 0 0.6 digital interference: the pen's speed
range arc level 0 0.3 the rise-fall surge lifted to C4 (sines only): the pen's acceleration
range arc ph_pos 0 1 the phaser notch, parked by the orb's curl
range cloud level 0 0.2 a gritty chord at C3, growing with the machine; spells raise it and pick the chord
range cloud voices 4 8
range cloud gather 0.5 1
bind stir hum level 0.2 0.15
bind stack hum level 0 -0.03 rel
bind stir swell level 0.08 0.18
bind orb.radius swell cutoff 0.5 0.9
bind tone.root root level 0 0.1
bind tone.third third level 0 0.09
bind tone.fifth fifth level 0 0.09
bind tone.seventh seventh level 0 0.07
bind coherence root lfo>amp 0.9 0.1
bind coherence third lfo>amp 0.9 0.1
bind coherence fifth lfo>amp 0.9 0.1
bind coherence seventh lfo>amp 0.9 0.1
bind fit root detune 0.3 0
bind fit third detune 0.3 0
bind fit fifth detune 0.3 0
bind fit seventh detune 0.3 0
bind orb.radius root cutoff 0.4 0.85
bind orb.radius third cutoff 0.4 0.85
bind orb.radius fifth cutoff 0.4 0.85
bind orb.radius seventh cutoff 0.4 0.85
bind orb.accel root drive 0.15 0.4
bind orb.accel fifth drive 0.15 0.4
bind stir sparks level 0.2 0.45
bind coherence sparks density 3 40
bind orb.speed crackle level 0 0.6
bind orb.curl crackle cutoff 0.5 1
bind orb.accel arc level 0 0.3
bind orb.curl arc ph_pos 0 1
bind stack cloud level 0 0.2
bind coherence cloud gather 0.5 1
bind stack cloud voices 4 8
note voltaic v1 (draft, 2026-10-02). Split out of luminal: sparks, hum and coil tones. Dry and close where luminal is drenched.
note The four jobs: alive = a synthesized mains hum at C2, slow spark ticks, the discovery drone surging at C3; notes = four saw 'coil' tones at C4 E4 G4 Bb4 (tone.*), each chopped by its own
note random gate; in tune = the gates close up (lfo>amp 0.9 -> 0.1 with coherence) and the spark ticks speed from 3 to 40 a second: erratic sparking
note fuses into a steady buzzing chord; fit takes the detune off each tone. Orb = interference crackle with the pen's speed, the lifted surge with its
note acceleration (phaser notch on its curl), the coils' filters with its radius, root and fifth drive with its acceleration.
note One-shots: sub thump on lock, a synthesized zap (C6 falling two octaves) on accept, a power-down sweep on unlock.
note The three recordings are from samples/luminal/ (tracked); luminal.sfx itself is untouched: it still has its Lightning spell and interference layer.
note Spells below are placeholders (Lightning is luminal's recipe and textures carried over): they exist so the score and the lock have something to find.

